# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# Data & models — too big for git, scripts recreate them
data/raw/
data/clean/
data/extra/
data/flores/
# data/ocr/ holds gigabytes of photographs and crops that the scripts recreate.
# Two things inside it are the exception, because nothing recreates them: the
# transcriptions. Those were read off the pictures one at a time and a lost
# machine loses them for good -- the same shape as the harvester that spent a
# week untracked while every photograph behind the reader's score depended on
# it. Git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so the
# directories are opened one level at a time down to the two files that matter.
data/ocr/*
!data/ocr/crops/
data/ocr/crops/*
!data/ocr/crops/labels-human.tsv
!data/ocr/label-answers/
!data/ocr/crops2/
data/ocr/crops2/*
!data/ocr/crops2/labels-human.tsv
!data/ocr/crops2-answers/
!data/ocr/real-photos/
data/ocr/real-photos/*
!data/ocr/real-photos/truth.json
!data/ocr/real-photos/scored-sample.txt
!data/ocr/real-photos/scored-sources.tsv
!data/ocr/real-photos/EXCLUDE-flat-artwork.txt
# The provenance of the harvest is the same shape of irreplaceable as the
# transcriptions, and it was untracked too. CREDITS.tsv is the only mapping
# from a local filename to the Commons page that licenses it: lose it and 286
# photographs become unattributable and therefore unusable, whatever survives
# on disk. screened.tsv is the only record of the 1,626 candidates that were
# judged, and the only route back to the 219 photographs the crops were cut
# from before the harvester deleted its own staging directory. staged.json
# carries the screen_url of every kept photograph -- the 1280px rendering that
# was actually read, not the different picture keep_url points at. All three
# are small; the photographs they describe are the gigabytes.
!data/ocr/real-photos/harvested/
data/ocr/real-photos/harvested/*
!data/ocr/real-photos/harvested/CREDITS.tsv
!data/ocr/real-photos/harvested/.state/
data/ocr/real-photos/harvested/.state/*
!data/ocr/real-photos/harvested/.state/screened.tsv
!data/ocr/real-photos/harvested/.state/staged.json
!data/ocr/real-photos/commons-cats/
data/ocr/real-photos/commons-cats/*
!data/ocr/real-photos/commons-cats/CREDITS.tsv
!data/ocr/real-photos/commons/
data/ocr/real-photos/commons/*
!data/ocr/real-photos/commons/CREDITS.txt
data/speech/
data/feedback.db
models/
*.zip
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.onnx

